{"body":"Dynamic\\/splat param values containing a literal `%` \\(encoded as `%25`\\) fail to match and 404\\, because `normalizePathname`\\'s `decodeURI` plus the per\\-param `decodeURIComponent` double\\-decode the pathname\\.\n\n\u003c!-- VADE-CATEGORY: logic --\u003e\n\u003c!-- VADE-GITHUB-SUGGESTION-ID:2a4224810e7a26a0b62c6cdec079a6e16f313a2506dc9c4f9cb236a28f621c5d --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- VADE-RECOMMENDATION: FIX --\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://vercel.com/vercel-labs/~/agent/tasks/5b72ce4e-5115-46fb-b55d-354bac4243fd#suggestion-2a4224810e7a26a0b62c6cdec079a6e16f313a2506dc9c4f9cb236a28f621c5d\" rel=\"noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\n    \u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://vercel.com/vercel-agent-view-suggestion-dark\"\u003e\n    \u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://vercel.com/vercel-agent-view-suggestion-light\"\u003e\n    \u003cimg src=\"https://vercel.com/vercel-agent-view-suggestion-light\" alt=\"Fix on Vercel\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\" /\u003e\n  \u003c/picture\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003c!-- VADE-GITHUB-REVIEW-BOT-ACTIVE --\u003e\n\u003c!-- VADE-GITHUB-REVIEW-BOT-SHA:70d73833945937bc24530cab23e934e0488427a1 --\u003e\n\u003c!-- VADE-GITHUB-REVIEW-BOT-BASE-SHA:ea3326046f57138671a238f7b1110ce5de015778 --\u003e\n\u003c!-- VADE-GITHUB-REVIEW-BOT-REVIEW-ID:fb6c657d67e405e5ceb5335f921c439f --\u003e\n\u003c!-- VADE-GITHUB-REVIEW-BOT-TASK-ID:5b72ce4e-5115-46fb-b55d-354bac4243fd --\u003e\n\u003c!-- VADE-GITHUB-REVIEW-BOT-VERSION:v2 --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- VADE-OUTCOME: ISSUE_RESOLVED --\u003e","commit":"8ada1493956ab69a9cede7c80964c9bafedcff0f","path":"packages/tanstack-start/src/router.ts","user":"vercel[bot]"}
{"body":"Fixed in commit 8ada149 via a different valid approach\\: `normalizePathname` now shields encoded percent signs with `withoutTrailingSlash.replace(/%25/gi, \"%2525\")` before `decodeURI`\\, making decodeURI a no\\-op for `%25` so param values decode exactly once\\. The double\\-decode \\/ 404 on literal `%` params no longer occurs\\. Verified `/products/100%25` \\-\\\u003e \\\"100\\%\\\"\\, splat cases\\, and that `%2F` single\\-decode and malformed\\-input null behavior are preserved\\.\n","commit":"8ada1493956ab69a9cede7c80964c9bafedcff0f","path":"packages/tanstack-start/src/router.ts","user":"vercel[bot]"}
